1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,029
Man: Are Alyssa and David back from studying abroad in Hong Kong?

2
00:00:08,029 --> 00:00:14,050
Woman: Yes, they returned last week. Alyssa's still adjusting to the time difference.

3
00:00:14,050 --> 00:00:19,484
Man: I can relate. I had bad jet lag last summer after travelling across the globe.

4
00:00:19,484 --> 00:00:23,220
I kept taking long naps which affected my sleep at night.

5
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:27,560
Woman: Yeah, instead of napping, getting outside for a walk

6
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:30,220
and sunlight helps reset your internal clock.

7
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:32,279
I told Alyssa the same.

8
00:00:32,279 --> 00:00:36,060
Man: Once she's over it, let's all have lunch.

9
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:45,010
Woman: Sounds good. She just needs to sort out credit for an extra course she took over there, then she'll be free.
